-Where the DeviceDefinition is referenced by other resources listed in <a href="https://build.fhir.org/devicedefinition.html#8.18.3">References</a> to this Resource, beyond Device, the DeviceDefinition is a choice between DeviceDefinition and a Device depending on whether a specific device is to be considered or a kind of device.  For example, a ServiceRequest may reference a specific device in the order details or a general class of device using a DeviceDefinition; an ObservationDefinition may specify either a particular device that always performs the observation or a category of device; and a Specimen record may document the exact device, or type of device, used for collection.
